From a567adfc3532c31283c287d9d705e91d4324321f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:15:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Data components and kept block data (API block 5)

Custom components ride on stacks (round trip tested); a Components helper
in the SDK reads and writes them; keep-data makes a block drop an item that
carries its entity's data and restores it on placing; item-charger example.
